  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You gain Diplomacy, Knowledge (local), Linguistics, and Sense Motive as class skills. If you fail a Diplomacy check to alter a creature’s attitude and the creature’s attitude would worsen, instead the creature’s attitude towards you is unchanged. A specific creature may only be affected by this ability once every 24 hours.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/vocation#toc56\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
